{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はガールズルールの発売日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位！すごい！\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/03/6010866/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO！見ましたか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時メンバーのお誕生日会の\n思い出いっぱい語ってたんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやホールケーキ4つて\n不自然過ぎる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/03/6010866/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深夜まで撮影だったので、\n顔べちゃべちゃで何が何だかわからず\nナチュラルハイでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ええ、楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ええ、楽しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやもう。\n何でもやります。\nむしろ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/03/6010866/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ねねのブログ読んで\nすぐLINEしたよ。\n生写真が私だったんだって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/03/6010866/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相当私のことすきみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もねねの写真当たったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは誰が当たったのかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーまいやんかなべちょまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/03/6010866/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体操着だ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/07/03/6010866/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うっわああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいいいいいいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}